# These files are only used by the PHP code on the server (PHP reads them from the disk, not through the web
# address), so nobody should be able to open them by typing their address in a browser.
# Source: Apache Software Foundation (no date) Apache HTTP Server 2.4 - mod_authz_core: Require all denied.
#         https://httpd.apache.org/docs/2.4/mod/mod_authz_core.html
Require all denied
